# Bluehost

> Bluehost is the complete platform empowering millions of small businesses, developers, and agencies worldwide to build, grow, and run online with confidence. Officially recommended by WordPress.org. Owned by Newfold Digital.

## Core Products

- [Shared Hosting](https://www.bluehost.com/web-hosting): Shared Linux hosting for websites, blogs, and small businesses.
- [VPS Hosting](https://www.bluehost.com/vps-hosting): Virtual private servers with dedicated resources, NVMe SSD storage, and root access.
- [Dedicated Hosting](https://www.bluehost.com/dedicated-hosting): Managed dedicated servers for high-resource workloads.
- [Cloud Hosting](https://www.bluehost.com/cloud-hosting): Managed multi-region cloud hosting optimized for WordPress.
- [Enterprise Hosting](https://www.bluehost.com/enterprise): Custom hosting infrastructure for enterprise-scale platforms.
- [AI All-Access Pack](https://www.bluehost.com/all-access): All-in-one AI subscription bundling ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and Grok for teams and agencies.

## WordPress Services

- [Managed WordPress Hosting](https://www.bluehost.com/wordpress-hosting): Managed WordPress hosting with automatic updates and performance optimization.
